prayerTemplate:
PRAYER

In the light of the facts and circumstances stated above, and as the statutory period under Section 187(3) BNSS, 2023 has expired without the police report being filed, it is most respectfully prayed that this Hon'ble Court may graciously be pleased to:

a) Release the applicant {applicant} on default bail under Section 187(3) BNSS, 2023 in connection with FIR No. {fir_number} dated {fir_date} of Police Station {police_station};
b) Direct release on such bond and sureties as this Hon'ble Court may deem fit;
c) Pass any other order(s) as this Hon'ble Court may deem fit and proper in the interest of justice.

And for this act of kindness, the applicant shall ever pray.
